                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "Fakt"@de ,
                                                                                                                         "fact"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "Note that in contrast to a signifier, information is dependent on accurate interpretation. Inaccurate interpretation of an signifier would not compromise the existence of the signifier itself, but would result in mis-information."@en ,
