###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000121
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000121> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "DEPRECATED TODO: see discussion at https://gitlab.hzdr.de/hmc/hmc/cct-7-semantics/hmc-glossary-initialization/-/merge_requests/88"@en ,
                                                                     """We deem this quality to no longer be relevant enough in the context of
data.

After all, all data is structure. What we sometimes call \"unstructured data\"
