                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2209-9385> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "De Facto Standard"@de ,
