                                                                                                                "de facto standard specification"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001003
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001003> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001001> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A standard specification which must be met in order to comply with a requirement issued by a competent legal authority."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Eine Standardspezifikation, die eingehalten werden muss um eine von einer befugten juristischen Instanz erlassene Anforderung zu befolgen."@de ;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2209-9385> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "De-jure-Standard"@de ,
                                                                                                                         "de jure standard"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "In order to be considered de jure, there must be some legally binding mechanism which declares that some standard specification must be used for a given purpose. This will naturally vary from jurisdiction to jurisdiction. For example, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) of the European Union includes a legally binding specification of the standard metadata that must be present in a privacy policy. This is in the form of, for example, a template for privacy policies: https://gdpr.eu/privacy-notice/"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "De-jure-Standardspezifikation"@de ,
                                                                   "de jure standard specification"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "De-jure-Standardspezifikationen"@de ,
                                                                                                                "de jure standard specifications"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001026> "De-jure-Standardspezifikation"@de ,
                                                                                                                "de jure standard specification"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001004
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001004> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001001> ;
