                                                                                                                       "computer application"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "When using a computer users might not be aware that their actions guide hardware operations. Hardware operations include the operation of RAM or the CPU. Hardware operation can thus be considered unavoidable when operating a computer. TODO: ongoing discussion at https://gitlab.hzdr.de/hmc/hmc/cct-7-semantics/hmc-glossary-initialization/-/merge_requests/61/diffs#82954dcd4b7d149e4f52b3a0df51f3e2cb416c4b"@en ;
