                                                        rdfs:comment "A web service is typically a software system designed to support interoperable machine-to-machine interaction over a network. The interface could either be a GUI or an API which is described in a machine-processable format. TODO: ongoing discussion at https://gitlab.hzdr.de/hmc/hmc/cct-7-semantics/hmc-glossary-initialization/-/merge_requests/61/diffs#82954dcd4b7d149e4f52b3a0df51f3e2cb416c4b"@en ;
