###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001046
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001046> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000033> ,
                                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001005> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A specification which defines the rules (syntax and grammar) that can be used to encode instructions to be executed by a processing unit. "@en ,
                                                                                                     "Eine Spezifikation, die die Regeln (Syntax und Grammatik) festlegt, welche verwendet werden können, um Anweisungen zu kodieren, die von einer Verarbeitungseinheit ausgeführt werden sollen. "@de ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> "Maschinensprache"@de ,
                                                                                                                        "machine language"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "Different programming languages provide different levels of abstraction relative to the hardware. A script in python has a higher level of abstraction than instructions that are encoded in binary code. Consequently, the instructions encoded in a programming language require a different level of translation steps in order to direct hardware, depending on what programming language they are implemented in. The use of an interpreter for the execution of a script, or its compilation to binary can be seen as such translation steps. TODO: ongoing discussion at https://gitlab.hzdr.de/hmc/hmc/cct-7-semantics/hmc-glossary-initialization/-/merge_requests/61/diffs#82954dcd4b7d149e4f52b3a0df51f3e2cb416c4b"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Programmiersprache"@de ,
                                                                   "programming language"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "Programmiersprachen"@de ,
                                                                                                                "programming languages"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001026> "Programmiersprache"@de ,
                                                                                                                "programming language"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001047
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001047> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001023> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Software which is embedded in hardware components to direct basic hardware functions or provide hardware abstraction services to higher-level software."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Software, die in Hardware-Komponenten eingebettet ist, um deren grundlegende Hardware-Funktionen zu steuern oder Hardware-Abstraktionsdienste für übergeordnete Software bereitzustellen."@de ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "In some cases, the involved hardware might be so simple or minimal, that it can be operated exclusively through firmware - in such a case firmware would act as the operating system of the device in question. TODO: ongoing discussion at https://gitlab.hzdr.de/hmc/hmc/cct-7-semantics/hmc-glossary-initialization/-/merge_requests/61/diffs#82954dcd4b7d149e4f52b3a0df51f3e2cb416c4b"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Firmware"@de ,
                                                                   "firmware"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "Firmware"@de ,
                                                                                                                "firmware"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001026> "Firmware"@de ,
                                                                                                                "firmware"@en .


