                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "Nomenklatur"@de ,
                                                                                                                       "nomenclature"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "Fachjargon"@de ,
                                                                                                                         "jargon"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "Because \"terminology\" also pertains to the study of terms, it's sometimes used as a broad class to refer to thesauri, ontologies, etc as they are often the output of this study."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Terminologie"@de ,
                                                                   "terminology"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A vocabulary which includes terms used within a community or a discipline."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Ein Vokabular, das Begriffe enthält, die innerhalb einer Disziplin verwendet werden."@de ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "Terminologien"@de ,
                                                                                                                "terminologies"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002007
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002007> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002006> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A terminology which relates terms to one another based on their synonymy or antonymy."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Eine Terminologie, die Begriffe auf der Grundlage ihrer Synonymie oder Antonymie miteinander in Beziehung setzt."@de ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thesaurus_(disambiguation)> ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "Thesauri often use types of synonymy or antonymy to relate terms to one another, and are often digitally encoded in SKOS. Thesauri may or may not include definitions, in which case they include a glossary as a part."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Thesaurus"@de ,
                                                                   "thesaurus"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A terminology in which terms are associated with their synonyms and antonyms."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Eine Terminologie, in der Begriffe mit ihren Synonymen und Antonymen in Beziehung gesetzt werden."@de ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "Thesauren"@de ,
                                                                                                                "Thesauri"@de ,
                                                                                                                "thesauri"@en ,
                                                                                                                "thesauruses"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002008
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002008> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00006028> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A semantic artefact which comprises a collection of terms."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Ein Datensatz der aus einer Sammlung von Begriffen besteht."@de ;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2209-9385> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://inmyownterms.com/is-this-a-glossary-a-lexicon-or-a-thesaurus-how-to-tell-them-apart/> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Vokabular> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "Wortschatz"@de ;
                                                        rdfs:comment """Vocabularies in general might not always be recorded or written down explicitly -  within the scope of HDO, this is seen as a sematic artefact and therefore data.within the scope.
Vocabularies are arbitrarily bounded, but are often restricted to a discipline or area of interest. Technically a vocabulary can consist of 2 terms or more."""@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Vokabular"@de ,
                                                                   "vocabulary"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A collection of terms."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Eine Sammlung von Begriffen."@de ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "Vokabulare"@de ,
                                                                                                                "vocabularies"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002009
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002009> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000104> ,
                                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002010> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A plan specification pertaining to the handling of data."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Eine Planungsspezifikation, die Ziel- und Handlungsvorgaben umfasst, die den Umgang mit Daten betreffen."@de ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003012> "DMP"@de ,
                                                                                                     "DMP"@en ;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2209-9385> ,
                                                                                                      <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4322-180X> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000104> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://codata.org/rdm-glossary/data-management-plan/> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://www.forschungsdaten.info/themen/informieren-und-planen/datenmanagementplan/> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "research data management plan"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "Data management plans often conform to standardised templates, however, many are ad hoc or informal."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Datenmanagementplan"@de ,
                                                                   "data management plan"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A guide describing a series of steps needed to handle data to meet one or more aims. For research data, a data management plan specifies what measures will be taken throughout and often beyond a research project to ensure that its data is well documented, findable, accessible, and reusable."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Ein Leitfaden, der eine Reihe von Schritten beschreibt, welche im Umgang mit Daten erforderlich sind, um eins oder mehrere Ziele zu erreichen. Im Falle von wissenschaflichen Daten legt ein Datenmanagementplan fest, welche Maßnahmen ergriffen werden sollen um sicherzustellen, dass diese Daten, während und nach einem Projekt, dokumentiert, auffindbar, zugänglich und wiederverwendbar sind. "@de ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001024> "Datenmanagementpläne"@de ,
                                                                                                                "data management plans"@en ;
                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001026> "Datenmanagementplan"@de ,
                                                                                                                "data management plan"@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002010
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002010> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000033> ,
                                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00001005> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A specification which (1) includes objective specifications and action specifications and (2) is intended to guide agents participating in a process."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Eine Spezifikation, die (1) Ziel- und Handlungsvorgaben beinhaltet und (2) darauf ausgelegt ist, an einem Prozess Beteiligte zu leiten. "@de ;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2209-9385> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000104> ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "This is an HMC variation of an ontological definition from the Information Artifact Ontology, set in alignment to the Basic Formal Ontology's treatment of generically and specifically dependent continuants. We do not include the notions of concretisation or realisation here, but may move towards them in more expressive adaptations of this thesaurus."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Planungsspezifikation"@de ,
                                                                   "plan specification"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A description of steps which can be followed to fulfill one or more objectives."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Eine Beschreibung von Schritten, die es ermöglichen, ein Ziel zu erreichen."@de .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002011
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002011> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A permission which is legally binding, and minimally specifies (1) the parties involved in the permission, (2) one or more entities for which the permission is being made, and (3) a list of rights one party (the licensor) grants to the other (the licensee) over the entities governed by the permission."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Eine Genehmigung die rechtlich bindend ist und mindestens (1) die beteiligten Parteien, (2) eine oder mehrerer Entitäten, für die die Genehmigung gilt und (3) die Rechte, die eine Partei (Lizenzgeber) der anderen (Lizenznehmer) über die in der Lizenz erfassten Entitäten gewährt, spezifiziert."@de ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0000002> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/License> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://spdx.org/licenses/> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "license"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "Lizenzvereinbarung"@de ,
                                                                                                                         "licence agreement"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment """A license agreement over digital assets or research outputs, in most cases, is a contract/agreement between the copyright holder of a resource (licensor) and a licensee who wants to use and/or redistribute this resource. A number of standard license-agreements can be found prepared in an ready-to-apply state on the web, such as the creative commons licenses (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/2.5/) or MIT lincense (https://opensource.org/license/mit/). 
Licensing is a legal matter, and this class and its definition are not authoritative.""" ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Lizenz"@de ,
                                                                   "license"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A license agreement is a legal instrument in which a legal entity grants rights over a protected work - such as those allowing usage, duplication, and redistribution - to another legal entity."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Eine Lizenzvereinbarung ist ein Rechtsinstrument, durch das eine juristische Person einer anderen juristischen Person bestimmte Rechte an einem geschützten Werk - wie Nutzungs-, Vervielfältigungs- und Weiterverbreitungsrechte - gewährt."@de .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002012
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002012> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> ,
                                                                        <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000025> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Information which identifies a license agreement that applies to a resource."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Information, die angibt, unter welche Lizenzvereinbarung eine Ressource veröffentlicht wurde."@de ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0000002> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/License> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://spdx.org/licenses/> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "licence information"@en ,
                                                                                                                       "licensing information"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "Lizenz"@de ,
                                                                                                                         "licence"@en ,
                                                                                                                         "license"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "This term pertains to the actual (meta)data used to identify the licensing agreement pertaining to a digital asset. It does not refer to the license agreement itself, which is a legal agreement. Thus information like (1) the string \"CC-BY\" as the value of a key \"license\" in a metadata set or (2) a corresponding logo issued by the licensing authority is license information, whereas the full text of the CC-BY NC 2.5 license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/2.5/) is the actual license agreement."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "Lizenzinformation"@de ,
                                                                   "license information"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Die Lizenzinformationen geben durch Text, Code oder andere beschreibende Elemente an, unter welcher Lizenz eine Ressource veröffentlicht wurde."@de ,
                                                                                                   "Licensing information is the text, code, or other descriptive element that identifies what license some resource is released under."@en .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002013
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00002013> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000009> ;
