###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00006014
<https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00006014> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000114> ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A data format which (1) defines the structure of data used to represent rich and complex knowledge about things and their relations, (2) is established as a standard, (3) is based on the W3C recommendation (OWL Web Ontology Language Reference), whose rules are published on https://www.w3.org/TR/owl-ref/."@en ,
                                                                                                     "Ein Datenformat, das (1) die Struktur von Daten definiert, die verwendet werden, um umfangreiches und komplexes Wissen über Dinge und ihre Beziehungen darzustellen, (2) als Standard etabliert ist, (3) auf der W3C-Empfehlung (OWL Web Ontology Language Reference) basiert, deren Regeln auf https://www.w3.org/TR/owl-ref/ veröffentlicht sind."@de ;
                                                        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003012> "OWL" ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_Ontology_Language> ,
                                                                                                                 <https://www.w3.org/OWL/> ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "OWL Spezifikation"@de ,
                                                                                                                       "OWL specification"@en ,
                                                                                                                       "Web Ontolgoy Language"@en ,
                                                                                                                       "Web Ontology Language"@de ,
                                                                                                                       "Web Ontology Language Spezifikation"@de ,
                                                                                                                       "Web Ontology Language specification"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> "OWL DL"@en ,
                                                                                                                        "OWL Full"@en ,
                                                                                                                        "OWL Lite"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "OWL2"@en ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "OWL is typically used to generate ontologies (i.e. formalise relations between entities). OWL is built on top of RDF and RDFs and is part of W3C’s Semantic Web technologies."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "OWL"@en ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "OWL is a data format used to build ontologies. Those formalising relations between entities to create rich context for data."@en .


